<title>USA: Genentech in pact with Roche.</title>
<headline>Genentech in pact with Roche.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genentech Inc on Wednesday entered a marketing agreement with Roche Holding Ltd unit Hoffmann La Roche under which Genentech will take over marketing of Roche's Roferon oncology drug.  </p>
<p>The deal was announced by Genentech President Arthur Levinson at the Hambrecht &amp; Quist healthcare conference here.</p>
<p>Details of the marketing pact were not immediately available although Levinson said a statement would be released shortly.</p>
<p>Roferon is a drug with a broad range of applications in the treatment of cancer.</p>
</text>
